{"code":"050090","name":"비케이홀딩스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"광고","sector_desc":"광고 대행·디지털 마케팅. 기업 광고 예산과 경기에 연동됩니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 설립되어 2004년 코스닥에 상장된 종합광고대행 전문기업임. 구미본사 및 서울지점을 기반으로 광고제작과 매체대행 서비스를 주요사업으로 하며, 2023년 반도체소재 사업부문 영업정지 후 광고사업에 집중하고 있음. 광고제작 부문에서는 TV, Radio, 신문, 잡지 등 매체별 광고물을 제작하고, 매체대행 부문에서 다양한 매체를 활용한 광고대행 서비스를 제공함.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":696.0,"open":696.0,"high":696.0,"low":696.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":-22.6667,"ret_60":142.5087,"ret_120":-12.782,"ret_250":-24.2655,"ma20":722.7,"ma60":660.9667,"ma120":625.2,"ma200":685.56,"close_vs_ma200":1.5228,"close_vs_ma60":5.3003,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":1583.5428,"r2_60":0.4573,"slope_120":26.0442,"r2_120":0.0124,"slope_250":-41.1952,"r2_250":0.3199,"high52":1196.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":58.194,"dd_52w":-41.806,"mdd_1y":-71.8627,"atr14_pct":63.4236,"vol_ann_60":176.5245,"vol_avg20":171083.65,"vol_ratio20":0.0,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.7026,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":106092232.2,"amount_avg60":226578811.15,"obv_chg20":-4.2346,"turnover_20":14.5388,"pv_eff_20":-1.559,"rsi14":47.1094,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":131723.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.5597,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.5597,"frgn_net_60":76430.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3248,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3248,"frgn_net_120":-145199.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.617,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.617,"foreign_ratio":1.68,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.36,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-7.0,"op_margin_q":-50.0,"op_qoq":36.3636,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":36.3636,"rev_yoy":-12.5,"op_trend_4q":-11.6129,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-30.22,"debt_ratio":26.15,"per":null,"pbr":1.36,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.68,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"c